    },
    {
      "id": "odfw",
      "name": "Oregon Department of Fish and Wildlife",
      "kind": "licensing",
      "notes": "Ocean sport-fishing regulator; its Ocean Recreational Boat Survey samples charter landings. Any charter vessel list would come through a public records request; none is held.",
